        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, adhiro jamikwenda paran yiko ran yo, aka Rwoth ma widwaro labino abwap i ot pere ma lamo. Go ma wimito neno labino tito cikirok paran.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
